 ${u}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(u{e}^{-5x})}^{′}+5(u{e}^{-5x}) & =2{e}^{-x} \\\\ {u}^{′}{e}^{-5x}-5u{e}^{-5x}+5u{e}^{-5x} & =2{e}^{-x} \\\\ {u}^{′}{e}^{-5x}-\\cancel{5u{e}^{-5x}}+\\cancel{5u{e}^{-5x}} & =2{e}^{-x} \\\\ {u}^{′}{e}^{-5x} & =2{e}^{-x} \\\\ {u}^{′} & =2{e}^{4x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating both sides with respect to $x$ (omitting the arbitrary constant), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′} & =2{e}^{4x} \\\\ \\int {u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 2{e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ u & =\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{4x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since ${y}_{p}=u(x){e}^{-5x},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p} & =u(x){e}^{-5x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{4x}\\cdot {e}^{-5x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535156 true] [17592186334395 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334396 13194139535156 true] [17592186334395 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334397 13194139535156 true] [17592186334395 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334398 13194139535156 true] [17592186334395 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334399 13194139535156 true] [17592186334395 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334400 13194139535156 true] [17592186334395 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139535156 true] [17592186334395 1041 "field-1" 13194139535156 true] [17592186334395 1104 #edb/ref 17592186334396 13194139535156 true] [17592186334395 1110 #uuid "69cc0f77-6ac5-52f3-a40d-83ef2ee033ae" 13194139535156 true] [17592186334396 1034 "u(x){e}^{-5x}" 13194139535156 true] [17592186334396 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535156 true] [17592186334396 1111 #uuid "93613f48-348c-5950-a6db-3fcaf4392705" 13194139535156 true] [17592186334397 1034 "u(x){e}^{5x}" 13194139535156 true] [17592186334397 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535156 true] [17592186334397 1111 #uuid "c65b486a-aca0-594c-aa78-acbb135c9c12" 13194139535156 true] [17592186334398 1034 "u(x){e}^{4x}" 13194139535156 true] [17592186334398 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535156 true] [17592186334398 1111 #uuid "02a6cece-6b1c-5f98-a1a5-0b4926de0c5d" 13194139535156 true] [175921